 ],
 "balloons": [
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "You ride in all weathers now.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "The marches do not stay still when the sun hides.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Sit. We have a matter to discuss that is not for the hall.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "You have been busy. Putting out small fires along the northern border.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You told me that was my work.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-04",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "It is. So is this.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "From Raghuji Bhonsle's camp.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "From one of his sardars. Carried by a trader who thought he was being clever and by a spy who was cleverer.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "SARDAR"
   ],
   "text": "You see further than I do, Nagoji. One day that will get you killed or much land.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "And you did not burn it. Interesting.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "It is not my place to burn your past. Only to weigh what it asks of your present.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You think this is a trick.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN (off)"
   ],
   "text": "Everything is a trick. That does not mean it is not also sincere.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "They ask for information. Not yet for betrayal.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "That comes later, if the first request goes unchallenged.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN (off)"
   ],
   "text": "I could have had the letter intercepted and never told you. Instead, I show you. Ask yourself why.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "You want to see what I do. You want to move me from the \"risk\" column in your books to the \"asset\" one, one way or the other.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "The Maharaja trusts you more than most of his own nobles. That trust has kept some of this kingdom's bones from breaking.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "It also makes you a potential crack.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-05",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "I prefer to test a wall before the storm does.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "They ask for what I know.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "If I tell them nothing, I insult men I once rode beside. If I tell them everything, I open this kingdom's ribs.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-05",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "If you tell them only what helps them avoid company mistakes without helping them cut us, you may keep two houses from collapsing on each other.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-05",
   "balloon": 4,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Half truths.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-05",
   "balloon": 5,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Selected truths.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "This is the test, Ananthan. Not whether you will ride north tomorrow. I do not believe you will.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN (off)"
   ],
   "text": "The test is whether, when confronted with a choice between making Travancore easier prey and making your old masters slightly less blind...",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN (off)"
   ],
   "text": "...you know where to place your weight.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Write. I will not guide your hand.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "I will read what you write. Then I will decide what to send.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "You have given them enough to avoid dying stupidly if they ever fight Europeans on beaches.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "You have not given them a clear path through our forts.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "If they do come, I would rather they hit Dutch and other company men effectively than stumble into our guns like idiots.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "But I will not pave their road over Padmini's fields or Velinadu's shrines.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "The messenger waits at the border. He is patient.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "And if he is not?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Then his horse will sink in sand one day and I will not weep.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "No.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "It is a good letter. It allows me to keep a foot in the north. To answer a friend. To be a Maratha who helps Travancore.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Yes.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I am not a Maratha who helps Travancore.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Not anymore.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN (soft)"
   ],
   "text": "Ananthan. Once you do this, there is no echo. You become silent to them.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I know.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I have no advice for the Bhonsle's men.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "My sword is here. My words stay here.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "You have closed a door on one future.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "You could have written a different letter, one that made this court easier to cut. We would have acted.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You would have cut me before they could cut you.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 4,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Yes. Today, I do not have to.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You keep this in your records.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "I keep it in mine. You keep it in your bones.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "There is one more thing. Since you have proven yourself today, you may as well know the shape of other pieces on the board.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "The Portuguese priest. Father Duarte. You confronted him when the embassy arrived.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I remember.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-05",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "He has been in my pay for eleven years.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "What?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN (off)"
   ],
   "text": "Since before you washed up on this coast.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "duarte"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN (off)"
   ],
   "text": "A man of conscience, he said. A man who had seen what his empire did to those it conquered and found the taste bitter.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "duarte"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "He tortured me. He watched while Jo\u00e3o...",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "duarte",
    "joao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN (off)"
   ],
   "text": "Yes. He did.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "duarte",
    "joao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN (off)"
   ],
   "text": "And then he spent years sending us reports on Portuguese troop movements.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "The European defectors.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN (off)"
   ],
   "text": "Some of them came because Father Duarte whispered in their ears.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "When he came with the embassy. Did he know...",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "That you had become one of our generals? Of course he knew. I told him myself, years ago.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN (off)"
   ],
   "text": "He asked to come. Perhaps he wanted to know if you would kill him.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "duarte",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN (off)"
   ],
   "text": "Perhaps he wanted to give you the chance.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "duarte",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Was any of it real? The guilt? The hesitation?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN (off)"
   ],
   "text": "All of it was real. That is why he is useful.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN (off)"
   ],
   "text": "He serves us because serving us is the only penance he can find.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "And you let me threaten him.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "I let you have your moment. You needed it. He needed it. Now you both know where you stand.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-04",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Where do we stand?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "On the same side of the wall.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Though you came to it by different doors.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DUARTE (flashback)"
   ],
   "text": "Then we are alike in that. More than I would have thought.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "duarte",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "That does not erase what he did. But it may change what it means.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "One more thing. The priest has asked to remain. Not as an envoy. Permanently.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "De Lannoy has been asking for a chaplain for years.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "This kingdom collects strange pieces.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "duarte",
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN (off)"
   ],
   "text": "This kingdom uses what it finds. As it used you. As it used me.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "duarte",
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Ram summoned you. He had the look he gets when balancing pots on a shelf.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "He tested a shelf. It did not crack.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Good. I am too old to build new ones for this house.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  }
 ]
}